<title>SRI LANKA: S.Lanka Tea Smallholder Q1 net up 69 pct.</title>
<headline>S.Lanka Tea Smallholder Q1 net up 69 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of rupes unless stated):</p>
<p>    Net profit	32.56   vs    19.29</p>
<p>    Turnover	 210.64   vs   165.68</p>
<p>    Tax		  6.39   vs    14.09</p>
<p>Note - Results are unaudited. Tea Smallholder Factories Ltd processes leaf bought from small cultivators. Blue chip John Keells Holdings Ltd has a 37 percent stake in the firm.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
